omething went wrong\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.HttpErrorsPages.TooManyRequestError.Close\":\"Close\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.HttpErrorsPages.TooManyRequestError.LimitReached.Hint [timer]\":\"Please come back later. Requests will be available after {{timer}}.\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.HttpErrorsPages.TooManyRequestError.LimitReached.Title\":\"You have reached the limit\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.HttpErrorsPages.TooManyRequestError.RefreshPage\":\"Refresh Page\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.InputMessage.Send\":\"Send\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.InputMessage.Tooltip.SelectFiles\":\"Select files\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.LangSelect.Label\":\"Language\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.MobileApp.QrCode.ButtonLabel\":\"More Download Options\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.MobileApp.QrCode.Label.Description\":\"Scan to Download App IOS & Android\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.OfflineBanner.Message\":\"You are currently offline. Please check your internet connection.\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentFailed.GoToHome\":\"Go to Homepage\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentFailed.SubTitle\":\"There was en error when processing your deposit\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentFailed.Title\":\"Deposit failed\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentProgress.GoToHome\":\"Go to Homepage\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentProgress.SubTitle\":\"You can check your transaction status in the transaction history\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentProgress.Title\":\"Deposit in process\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentSuccess.GoToHome\":\"Go to Homepage\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentSuccess.SubTitle\":\"The deposit was successfully completed\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PaymentPages.PaymentSuccess.Title\":\"Successful deposit\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PrivacyPolicyPage.GeneralDescription\":\"<h1 style='margin:24px 0 36px'>Privacy Policy</h1><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>1. Introduction</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, process, and protect your Personal Information when you access or use our trading platform and related services (the 'Platform' or 'Services').</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring that your Personal Information is processed in accordance with applicable data protection laws, including the General Data Protection Regulation (EU) 2016/679 ('GDPR') and other relevant legislation.</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'>By registering for and using the Platform, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy and agree to the collection, use, and disclosure of your Personal Information as described herein.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>2. Definitions</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'><strong>'Personal Information'</strong> refers to any information that identifies or can be used to identify an individual, either directly or indirectly, such as name, email address, phone number, financial information, and identification documents.</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'><strong>'User'</strong> refers to any individual or legal entity that accesses or uses the Platform.</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'><strong>'We,' 'Us,' 'Our'</strong> refers to the operator of the Platform.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>3. Information We Collect</h2><h3>3.1 Information You Provide Directly</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We collect the following categories of Personal Information when you register for an account or use our Services:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> name, email address, phone number, residential address, mailing address</li><li><strong>Account Information:</strong> username, password, account preferences</li><li><strong>Identity Verification Information:</strong> government-issued identification documents, passport, national ID card, driving license, proof of address, and other documents required for identity verification procedures</li><li><strong>Financial Information:</strong> bank account details, payment information, transaction history, trading activity, account balances</li><li><strong>Professional Information:</strong> for legal entities \u2014 company registration documents, beneficial ownership information, authorized representative details</li><li><strong>Communications:</strong> records of your communications with our support team, feedback, and inquiries</li></ul><h3>3.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>When you access or use the Platform, we automatically collect certain technical information, including:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li><strong>Device Information:</strong> device type, operating system, browser type and version, unique device identifiers</li><li><strong>Log Data:</strong> IP address, access times, pages viewed, referring URLs, actions taken on the Platform</li><li><strong>Usage Information:</strong> features used, trading patterns, session duration, interaction with the Platform interface</li></ul><h3>3.3 Information from Third Parties</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We may receive Personal Information about you from third parties, including:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Identity verification and KYC service providers</li><li>Financial institutions and payment processors</li><li>Trading platforms and exchanges integrated with our Services</li><li>Analytics service providers</li><li>Regulatory authorities and law enforcement agencies (where required by law)</li></ul><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>4. How We Use Your Information</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We process your Personal Information for the following purposes:</p><h3>4.1 Provision of Services</h3><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>To create and manage your account</li><li>To process your transactions and trading activities</li><li>To provide customer support and respond to your inquiries</li><li>To facilitate deposits, withdrawals, and transfers</li><li>To enable integration with third-party trading platforms</li></ul><h3>4.2 Legal and Regulatory Compliance</h3><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>To verify your identity in accordance with Know Your Customer (KYC) requirements</li><li>To comply with Anti-Money Laundering (AML) and Counter-Terrorist Financing (CTF) obligations</li><li>To fulfill tax reporting requirements</li><li>To respond to legal requests and prevent illegal activities</li><li>To maintain records as required by applicable laws and regulations</li></ul><h3>4.3 Security and Fraud Prevention</h3><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>To protect the Platform and Users from unauthorized access</li><li>To detect, investigate, and prevent fraudulent or suspicious activities</li><li>To enforce our terms and conditions</li><li>To ensure the integrity and security of our systems</li></ul><h3>4.4 Platform Improvement</h3><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>To analyze usage patterns and improve Platform functionality</li><li>To develop new features and services</li><li>To conduct research and analytics</li><li>To personalize your experience on the Platform</li></ul><h3>4.5 Communications</h3><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>To send you important notices regarding your account and transactions</li><li>To provide updates about changes to our Services or policies</li><li>To send marketing communications (where you have provided consent)</li></ul><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>5. Legal Basis for Processing</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We process your Personal Information based on the following legal grounds:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li><strong>Performance of a Contract:</strong> Processing is necessary for the performance of our agreement with you or to take steps at your request prior to entering into an agreement.</li><li><strong>Legal Obligation:</strong> Processing is necessary to comply with our legal and regulatory obligations.</li><li><strong>Legitimate Interests:</strong> Processing is necessary for our legitimate interests, such as fraud prevention, security, and Platform improvement, provided that such interests are not overridden by your rights and freedoms.</li><li><strong>Consent:</strong> Where required by law, we will obtain your consent before processing your Personal Information for specific purposes, such as marketing communications.</li></ul><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>6. Disclosure of Personal Information</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We may disclose your Personal Information to the following categories of recipients:</p><h3>6.1 Service Providers</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We engage third-party service providers to perform functions on our behalf, including:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Identity verification and KYC providers</li><li>Cloud hosting and data storage providers</li><li>Analytics service providers</li><li>Customer support tools</li><li>Payment processors</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>All service providers are contractually obligated to protect your Personal Information and use it only for the purposes for which it was disclosed.</p><h3>6.2 Trading Platforms and Exchanges</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>To facilitate your trading activities, we may share necessary information with integrated trading platforms and exchanges that you choose to use.</p><h3>6.3 Regulatory and Legal Authorities</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We may disclose your Personal Information to:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Regulatory bodies and supervisory authorities</li><li>Law enforcement agencies</li><li>Tax authorities</li><li>Courts and tribunals</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Such disclosures are made when required by law, regulation, court order, or legal process.</p><h3>6.4 Business Transfers</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>In the event of a merger, acquisition, reorganization, or sale of assets, your Personal Information may be transferred to the acquiring entity, subject to the same privacy protections.</p><h3>6.5 With Your Consent</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We may share your Personal Information with other third parties when you have given us explicit consent to do so.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>7. International Data Transfers</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Your Personal Information may be transferred to, stored, and processed in countries other than your country of residence. When we transfer Personal Information internationally, we ensure that appropriate safeguards are in place to protect your information in accordance with applicable data protection laws.</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'>These safeguards may include:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Standard contractual clauses approved by relevant authorities</li><li>Adequacy decisions recognizing the destination country's data protection standards</li><li>Other legally recognized transfer mechanisms</li></ul><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>8. Data Retention</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We retain your Personal Information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected, including:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>For the duration of your account with us</li><li>For a minimum of five (5) years after the termination of our relationship, in accordance with record-keeping obligations under financial regulations</li><li>As required to comply with legal, regulatory, tax, or accounting requirements</li><li>As necessary to resolve disputes and enforce our agreements</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Upon expiration of the retention period, your Personal Information will be securely deleted or anonymized.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>9. Data Security</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your Personal Information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. These measures include:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Encryption of data in transit and at rest</li><li>Access controls and authentication mechanisms</li><li>Regular security assessments and monitoring</li><li>Employee training on data protection</li><li>Incident response procedures</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Despite our efforts, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure. We cannot guarantee absolute security of your Personal Information.</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'>You are responsible for:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials</li><li>Using strong, unique passwords</li><li>Notifying us immediately of any unauthorized access to your account</li><li>Keeping your devices and software secure</li></ul><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>10. Your Rights</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Subject to applicable law, you have the following rights regarding your Personal Information:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li><strong>Right of Access:</strong> You have the right to obtain confirmation of whether we process your Personal Information and to access such information.</li><li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> You have the right to request correction of inaccurate or incomplete Personal Information.</li><li><strong>Right to Erasure:</strong> You have the right to request deletion of your Personal Information, subject to legal and regulatory retention requirements.</li><li><strong>Right to Restriction:</strong> You have the right to request restriction of processing in certain circumstances.</li><li><strong>Right to Data Portability:</strong> You have the right to receive your Personal Information in a structured, commonly used, machine-readable format.</li><li><strong>Right to Object:</strong> You have the right to object to processing based on legitimate interests or for direct marketing purposes.</li><li><strong>Right to Withdraw Consent:</strong> Where processing is based on consent, you have the right to withdraw consent at any time without affecting the lawfulness of prior processing.</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>To exercise your rights, please contact us using the details provided in Section 14. We will respond to your request within the timeframe required by applicable law.</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Please note that certain requests may be subject to limitations where we are required to retain information for legal, regulatory, or compliance purposes.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>11. Automated Decision-Making</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We may use automated processes to detect fraud, assess risk, and ensure compliance with legal requirements. Where such processing produces legal effects or significantly affects you, you have the right to request human intervention, express your point of view, and contest the decision.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>12. Third-Party Links</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>The Platform may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of such third parties. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>13. Children's Privacy</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Our Services are not directed to individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect Personal Information from children. If we become aware that we have collected Personal Information from a child, we will take steps to delete such information.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>14. Contact Information</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>If you have questions, concerns, or complaints about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'><strong>Email:</strong> <a href='mailto:'></a></p><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We will investigate and attempt to resolve any complaints regarding the use of Personal Information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>15. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or applicable laws. When we make material changes, we will notify you through the Platform or by other appropriate means. The updated Privacy Policy will be effective as of the date indicated at the top of the document.</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically to stay informed about how we protect your information.</p><hr><h1 style='margin: 24px 0 36px'>Cookie Policy</h1><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>1. Introduction</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>This Cookie Policy explains how we use cookies and similar technologies on our Platform. By using our Platform, you consent to the use of cookies as described in this policy.</p> <h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>2. What Are Cookies?</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device (computer, tablet, or mobile phone) when you visit a website. Cookies help websites recognize your device and remember information about your visit, such as your preferences and settings.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>3. Types of Cookies We Use</h2><h3>3.1 Strictly Necessary Cookies</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>These cookies are essential for the operation of our Platform. They enable core functionality such as:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>User authentication and secure login</li><li>Session management</li><li>Security features and fraud prevention</li><li>Navigation between pages without losing previous actions</li><li>Remembering your cookie consent preferences</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>These cookies cannot be disabled as the Platform cannot function properly without them.</p><h3>3.2 Functional Cookies</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>These cookies enable enhanced functionality and personalization, including:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Remembering your language and region preferences</li><li>Storing your display preferences</li><li>Recognizing you when you return to the Platform</li><li>Providing personalized features</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>If you disable these cookies, some features may not function correctly.</p><h3>3.3 Analytics Cookies</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>These cookies help us understand how Users interact with our Platform by collecting information such as:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Number of visitors and traffic sources</li><li>Pages visited and time spent on each page</li><li>Features used and user behavior patterns</li><li>Technical errors and performance issues</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>All information collected by analytics cookies is aggregated and anonymized. We may use third-party analytics services, including but not limited to:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>Amplitude</li><li>RudderStack</li><li>Datadog</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>These services help us measure and improve Platform performance.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>4. Cookie Duration</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We use two types of cookies based on duration:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li><strong>Session Cookies:</strong> Temporary cookies that are deleted when you close your browser.</li><li><strong>Persistent Cookies:</strong> Cookies that remain on your device for a set period or until you delete them. These cookies are activated each time you visit the Platform.</li></ul><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>5. Third-Party Cookies</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Some cookies may be placed by third-party service providers that perform services on our behalf. These third parties have their own privacy policies governing the use of cookies.</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We do not have control over third-party cookies. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of these third parties.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>6. Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>You can manage your cookie preferences in the following ways:</p><h3>6.1 Browser Settings</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can typically:</p><ul style='margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 40px; list-style: disc'><li>View cookies stored on your device</li><li>Delete all or specific cookies</li><li>Block all cookies or cookies from specific sites</li><li>Set preferences for certain types of cookies</li></ul><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Please note that blocking or deleting cookies may affect the functionality of our Platform.</p><h3>6.2 Cookie Consent</h3><p style='padding: 0 24px'>When you first visit our Platform, you will be presented with a cookie consent banner that allows you to accept or customize your cookie preferences. You can change your preferences at any time through the cookie settings available on the Platform.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>7. Do Not Track Signals</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>Some browsers offer a 'Do Not Track' feature that signals to websites that you do not wish to be tracked. Our Platform does not currently respond to Do Not Track signals.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>8. Updates to This Cookie Policy</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. When we make changes, we will update the effective date and notify Users through the Platform.</p><h2 style='margin: 16px 0 24px'>9. Contact Us</h2><p style='padding: 0 24px'>If you have questions about our use of cookies, please contact us at:</p><p style='padding: 0 24px'><strong>Email:</strong><a href='mailto:'></a></p>\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.PrivacyPolicyPage.Title\":\"Privacy & Cookie Policy\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.Rate.Empty\":\"Select balances to view the rate\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.Rate.Error\":\"Error! Exchange of this currency is not available now.\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.Rate.Expired\":\"Expired\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.Rate.Label\":\"Rate\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.Rate.Tooltip.RefreshExpiredRate\":\"Refresh rate\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.Rate.Tooltip.RefreshRate\":\"Refresh rate\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.ThemeChanger.DarkThemeMenuTitle\":\"Dark Theme\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.ThemeChanger.DarkThemeTitle\":\"Switch to Light Theme\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.ThemeChanger.LightThemeTitle\":\"Switch to Dark Theme\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionDetailsDialog.Account\":\"Account\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionDetailsDialog.CancelTransaction\":\"Cancel Request\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionDetailsDialog.Details\":\"Details\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionDetailsDialog.Method\":\"Method\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionDetailsDialog.Reason\":\"Reason\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionDetailsDialog.Time\":\"Time\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionList.Amount\":\"Amount\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionList.Consts.TransactionHeader.Account\":\"Account\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionList.Consts.TransactionHeader.Amount\":\"Amount\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionList.Consts.TransactionHeader.AmountFrom\":\"Amount From\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionList.Consts.TransactionHeader.AmountTo\":\"to\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionList.Consts.TransactionHeader.From\":\"From\",\"B2Core.Shared.UiKit.TransactionList.Consts.Transactio