 price alert to get notified when the market hits your target price. You'll receive notifications in Alerts, the \u201cMessages\u201d widget, and your mobile app.\",\"ScopeBoards.FeatureTradingBoard.Constants.IntroductionTourTranslations.B2Trader.StopOrders.IntroductionMessage\":\"Track and manage your stop orders in the \u201cStop Orders\u201d widget.\",\"ScopeBoards.FeatureTradingBoard.Constants.IntroductionTourTranslations.B2Trader.TradingView.IntroductionMessage\":\"Follow price movements and use technical analysis with the Price Chart widget. You can also turn on or turn off additional chart features in the settings.\",\"ScopeBoards.FeatureTradingBoard.Constants.IntroductionTourTranslations.B2Trader.WatchList.IntroductionMessage\":\"Keep track of the latest market prices and statistics using the \u201cWatch List\u201d widget.\",\"ScopeBoards.FeatureTradingBoard.Constants.IntroductionTourTranslations.Bbp.MessagesIntroductionMessage\":\"The \u201cMessages\u201d widget stores all alerts received over the last three months.\",\"ScopeBoards.FeatureTradingBoard.Constants.IntroductionTourTranslations.OpenSettingsButton.IntroductionMessage\":\"Manage various terminal settings and account margin settings where you can select assets to use as margin for trading.\",\"ScopeBoards.FeatureTradingBoard.Constants.IntroductionTourTranslations.Sidenav.IntroductionMessage\":\"The top panel allows you to select your trading account and organize your working tabs efficiently.\",\"ScopeBoards.FeatureTradingBoard.Constants.IntroductionTourTranslations.Welcome.IntroductionMessage\":\"Take a quick tour to explore key terminal settings and widgets \u2014 everything you need to customize your workspace and start trading with ease.\",\"ScopeBoards.FeatureTradingBoard.Constants.IntroductionTourTranslations.WidgetHeaderSelectInstrument.IntroductionMessage\":\"The search button in the widget header provides a quick and convenient way to find a market and apply it to a specific widget.\",\"Sc